INSERT INTO messages VALUES ('g-1a11178b91ab138c','rcahmw','2026-10-06T13:47:33Z','received','RC26-0375 - Ty Mawr/ Great House, Llandough, Cardiff - Further response','1) Our searches have been extensive: registered files (the only administrative records held long-term), full term-based and spatial searches of the NMRW archive catalogue, and a manual search for uncatalogued material, using all relevant site names and terms you enumerated — except the historic aerial photography collections, which would incur a charge.

